      "spam": false,
      "value": "This would be quite an effort technically-speaking. Discord only recently implemented desktop sharing, and it took them almost a year of development to get it to a point that they were comfortable with. Getting that same functionality in VRChat-- an app with tangential use cases at best, and a relatively tiny dev team-- would be extremely difficult and a divergence from the \"ideal\" feature set.\n\nOnce VideoPanels support streaming, however, it might be reasonable to stream tutorials live in VRChat.\n\nI'd suggest that if you want to share desktop with someone, you use Discord. If you don't have access to screen-sharing yet, you could use Bigscreen, Teamviewer, or Skype.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
